// T3: Recent tool calls with arguments and results
// A live feed of what agents called and with what: the first 300 characters of arguments and results.
AgentToolCalls(1d)
| project timestamp, Agent, Tool, ToolType, Arguments = substring(Arguments, 0, 300), Result = substring(Result, 0, 300),
          Succeeded, DurationMs = round(DurationMs), User, ConversationId
| order by timestamp desc
| take 200
